cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite ganlive when using it in research, software, or creative work."
type: software
title: "ganlive: Real-time GAN latent-space exploration with MIDI"
authors:
  - family-names: Cortal
    given-names: Gustave
abstract: >-
  ganlive is a Python tool for exploring generative adversarial network (GAN)
  latent spaces in real time. It creates automatic dials and supports mouse
  controls, MIDI notes and controller knobs, model switching, and recording.
  It loads StyleGAN2 and FastGAN checkpoints and compatible ONNX generators.
repository-code: "https://github.com/gustavecortal/ganlive"
url: "https://github.com/gustavecortal/ganlive"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - generative adversarial networks
  - latent space exploration
  - real-time visuals
  - MIDI
  - generative art
  - StyleGAN2
  - FastGAN
  - ONNX
